#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:6
msgid "# execute_code Multi-Runtime"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:8
msgid ""
"> One tool, multiple runtimes; default Bun; extend with Python / Deno as "
"needed."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:10
msgid "## Background"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:12
msgid ""
"`execute_code` runs short scripts in a controlled subprocess. The LLM must "
"know which language to write and which runtime to pick — otherwise Python "
"sent to Node fails."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:14
msgid "## Division from terminal"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"|           | `execute_code`                               | `terminal`                              |\n"
"| --------- | -------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Execution | No shell, fixed runtime                      | shell=true                              |\n"
"| Best for  | Short scripts, data processing, logic checks | System commands, pipes, git, long tasks |\n"
"| Output    | 50KB cap, configurable timeout               | Same limits but more freedom            |\n"
"| Security  | Smaller surface (no shell injection)         | Larger surface                          |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:23
msgid ""
"Use `execute_code(runtime=\"python\")` for Python batches, not `python3 -c "
"\"...\"` in terminal."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:25
msgid "## API"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:33
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"execute_code({\n"
"  code: string,\n"
"  runtime?: \"bun\" | \"nodejs\" | \"python\" | \"deno\",  // default bun\n"
"  timeout?: number,       // seconds, default 300, max 600\n"
"})\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:35
msgid "## Available Runtimes"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:42
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| runtime    | Language                | Status                  |\n"
"| ---------- | ----------------------- | ----------------------- |\n"
"| **bun**    | TypeScript / JavaScript | ✅ default              |\n"
"| **nodejs** | TypeScript / JavaScript | ✅ implemented          |\n"
"| **python** | Python                  | 🔲 reserved (Issue #40) |\n"
"| **deno**   | TypeScript              | 🔲 reserved (Issue #40) |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:44
msgid "## Configuration (Reserved)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:57
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```yaml\n"
"execute_code:\n"
"  default_runtime: bun\n"
"  runtimes:\n"
"    nodejs:\n"
"      enabled: true\n"
"    python:\n"
"      enabled: true\n"
"      command: python3\n"
"    deno:\n"
"      enabled: false\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:59
msgid "Disabled runtimes return a clear error listing available runtimes."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:61
msgid "## Security"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:65
msgid "Always `shell: false` (see [`security.md`](../guide/security.md))"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:65
msgid "Timeout and output size limits match current implementation"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:65
msgid "**Do not** auto-guess runtime from code content"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:67
msgid "## Credential Injection (Planned)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:69
msgid ""
"Architecture allows credential path injection in `execute_code` environments "
"— **not yet implemented**. See [Issue #40](https://github.com/freeanima-org/"
"freeanima/issues/40)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/execute-code-runtimes.md:70
msgid ""
"Credential values are never exposed to the LLM; injected from pass at "
"runtime — no pass CLI inside runtimes."
msgstr ""
